        <p>Besant is interesting herself in a scheme for start- ing, a profit-sharing laundry. Queen Natalie possesses the most beautiful teeth of any royal personage in the world. Queen Marguerite of Italy claims to have the sandals worn by the Emperor Nero. The favourite colour of the German Empress is pale blue. There are 80,000 barmaids in England, whose hours average 14 daily, for a wage of 103. per week. „ ,P 4 The ex-Empress Eugenie spends much of her time in making clothes, which +lra given to convent orphan- ages.</p>
