        <p>Adam Eck, a broom-maker, of Portsmouth, Ohio, who has been totally blind for 30 years, has issued a challenge to any blind man in the State for a finish fight, Marquis of Queenshury rules, for SlOO a Eide, Eck has put up a forfeit of s2b.</p>
