        <p>BROOKE, BOND ic Co. Think of the millions of mon, women, and chill. dron in our teeming land and then realise that Brooke, Bond ic Co. supply one out of every thirty in those myriads with Tea. TtiAT FACT IS THE BEST PROOF OF VALUE. WE DO NOT FEAR COMPETITION, and we court comparison, for our position is impregnable. WHY? BECAUSE we buy for " cash " and sell for " cash " many million pounds of Tea every year; so we can sell and do sell every pound for the smallest profit. We deal in TEA ONLY. It is plain Indeed that a firm which devotes all its attention to Tea alone must give the Public the best possible value In Tea. Our gigantic business has been established twenty-three years, our reputation is so high, and we have altogether so much at stake that we are thus bound by the best and surest of all guaran- tees to de the atmost possible for the Public sal for you. WILL YOU NOW TRY THE TEA ITSELF I, It is sold in Ono-pound, Half-pound, and Quarter- pound Packets. Each is prepared and sealed by us at our own Warehouses, and Dears our Signature and celebrated Trade Mark of the double-triangle or six-pointed star. OUR AGENTS draw their supplies; constantly from us, and they sell exactly the same Tea at the same prices as at our celebrated warehouses. 1/'", 1/2, 1/4, 1/8, 2/=., 2/4 or 2/8 per I. WE ARE GLAD to receive applications for Agencies In this District from energetic trades- people. Selling our Tea is already a regular annuity to thousands of enterprising men cad woniect. BROOKE, BOND, &amp; CO., LIMITED, 17, PICCADILLY, MANCHESTER, AND AT LEEDS. BRADFORD, AND LONDON.</p>
